BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:great-american-smokeout-20261119@todaycelebrates.com
DTSTAMP:20261014T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261120
SUMMARY:Great American Smokeout
DESCRIPTION:The Great American Smokeout is the American Cancer Society's an
 nual invitation to people who smoke to stop for one day\, on the premise t
 hat a single fixed date is a plan someone can actually start on. It falls 
 on the third Thursday of November\, which in 2026 is November 19. The Soci
 ety has run it nationally since 1977\, a year after a California event per
 suaded close to a million people to quit for the day.\n\nhttps://todaycele
 brates.com/holiday/great-american-smokeout/
URL;VALUE=URI:https://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/great-american-smokeout/
CATEGORIES:Health
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
